<title>JAPAN: Towa Real up on news of financial support.</title>
<headline>Towa Real up on news of financial support.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Towa Real Estate Development Co Ltd were higher in mid-morning Tuesday trade as investors welcomed news that it was getting financial support from its shareholders, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0120 GMT, the shares were 23 yen higher at 480 yen, with trading volume of 373,000 shares.</p>
<p>The firm said it will get assistance from its largest shareholder Fujita Corp and eight banks.</p>
</text>
